  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Impact Week: Fostering Lasting Opportunities in Water (FLOW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Steering Committee (JSC), held 28-30 November 2023 in the framework of the Memorandum of Understanding on Water (MoU Water) between the Governments of the Netherlands and Indonesia, has provided a strategic framework and momentum for continued collaboration between the both countries.This assignment aims to contribute to the facilitation and organisation of the Water Impact Week. Being held one year after the JSC, the Water Impact Week is an opportunity to highlight the fruitful collaboration under the MoU Water, celebrate successes, and showcase collaborative efforts. As such, the event aims to help strengthen the operationalisation of the joined vision set out during the JSC, foster partnerships and identify new collaborative opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
